	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg10849"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=570" title="View the profile of Castamist">Castamist</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Female.gif" alt="Female" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 32<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								<a href="http://web.icq.com/whitepages/about_me/1,,,00.html?Uin=4859621" target="_blank"><img src="http://web.icq.com/whitepages/online?icq=4859621&amp;img=5" alt="4859621" width="18" height="18" border="0" /></a>
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=570"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:castamist@hotmail.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1082.msg10849#msg10849"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1082.msg10849#msg10849">Re: What's your favorite Rumor?</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #20 on:</b> September 05, 2004, 10:00:40 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Forsaken only required us to injest 1 baby and personally, I was still hungry afterwards.  I think lil Iksars are less filling but do taste great. <br /><br /><br />hmm... a rumor from today...lemme reflect..<br /><br />I didn&#039;t hear any rumors today so I will post about the rumors I almost started today:  <br /><br />The first was about how the RN guilds all formed an alliance and teamed up against the mobs and SoE (the real enemies) and not each other.. And the second was about when Ascent was the last guild on the RN server because all the other guilds became addicted playing the highly competitive online tournaments of the classic Rock, Paper, Scissors. It was kind of cool how all the guilds reformed for the tournaments... Oh... almost forgot.. the rumor that Hemorrhage of Ruination is an ogre in RL. <br /><br />Unfortunately, right before I started spreading the rumors I forgot what I was doing and went to make a hot pocket instead. The hot pocket was delicious.<br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
