							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I have serveral favorite rumors I wil only name 2 though<br /><br />1. When EQ2 comes out that EQ1 will shut down all the servers and concentrate on EQ2.<br /><br /><br />2. Rumor has it that Forsaken disbanded and now they are called Ruination unfortunely this is true because most forsaken members are Forsaken..&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/wiggle2.gif" alt="Wiggle" border="0" /><br /><br />Oh and by the way I have nothing against Ruination I am just being a tard with number&nbsp; 2 cause its true&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/devil1.gif" alt="Devil" border="0" /><br /><br />Colleen Quickness<br />65 Ranger Apotheosis&nbsp; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/cool.gif" alt="Cool" border="0" />
